1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,212
Chunk-02.

2
00:00:01,212 --> 00:00:04,136
Lynch, the head housekeeper, appeared in the doorway.

3
00:00:04,136 --> 00:00:07,115
She didn't gasp in horror at June's pale face.

4
00:00:07,115 --> 00:00:09,352
Instead, her eyes darted to the floor.

5
00:00:09,352 --> 00:00:12,077
"Good heavens," Mrs. Lynch muttered in disgust.

6
00:00:12,077 --> 00:00:13,757
"You've ruined the antique rug. "

7
00:00:13,757 --> 00:00:16,059
Paramedics shoved past the housekeeper.

8
00:00:16,059 --> 00:00:20,243
They dropped a medical bag and knelt beside June."Ma'am.Can you hear me.

9
00:00:20,243 --> 00:00:23,429
" a paramedic shouted, shining a penlight into her eyes.

10
00:00:23,429 --> 00:00:24,509
June couldn't speak.

11
00:00:24,509 --> 00:00:26,050
The room started to spin.

12
00:00:26,050 --> 00:00:27,796
They lifted her onto a stretcher.

13
00:00:27,796 --> 00:00:33,222
The movement sent a fresh wave of agony through her pelvis, and a silent tear slid down her temple.

14
00:00:33,222 --> 00:00:36,116
Inside the ambulance, the fluorescent lights flickered.

15
00:00:36,116 --> 00:00:37,613
"Blood pressure is tanking.

16
00:00:37,613 --> 00:00:40,543
" a medic yelled over the siren."Eighty over forty.

17
00:00:40,543 --> 00:00:43,809
Suspected ruptured ectopic pregnancy.Step on it. "

18
00:00:43,809 --> 00:00:46,375
The doors of the emergency room flew open.

19
00:00:46,375 --> 00:00:50,222
The wheels of the gurney rattled violently against the linoleum floor.

20
00:00:50,222 --> 00:00:54,892
The overhead lights passed by in a dizzying blur.Nurses swarmed her.

21
00:00:54,892 --> 00:00:57,093
Scissors cut through her blood-soaked clothes.

22
00:00:57,093 --> 00:00:58,288
"Where is the family.

23
00:00:58,288 --> 00:01:00,413
" a doctor demanded, holding a clipboard.

24
00:01:00,413 --> 00:01:01,586
"Where is the husband.

25
00:01:01,586 --> 00:01:03,901
We need consent for emergency surgery. "

26
00:01:03,901 --> 00:01:06,525
A nurse leaned over June."Mrs. Compton.

27
00:01:06,525 --> 00:01:07,665
Where is your husband. "

28
00:01:07,665 --> 00:01:10,104
June forced her heavy eyelids open.

29
00:01:10,104 --> 00:01:12,218
She looked at the nurse.Her lips trembled.

30
00:01:12,218 --> 00:01:15,784
"He. " June's voice was a broken whisper."He won't come. "

31
00:01:15,784 --> 00:01:17,737
The doctor didn't wait."We're losing her.

32
00:01:17,737 --> 00:01:19,301
Get her to the OR now. "

33
00:01:19,301 --> 00:01:22,024
The heavy doors of the operating room swung shut.

34
00:01:22,024 --> 00:01:24,576
A mask was clamped over her nose and mouth.

35
00:01:24,576 --> 00:01:27,668
The sweet, chemical smell of anesthesia filled her lungs.

36
00:01:27,668 --> 00:01:31,113
Her last conscious thought was the sound of Cole hanging up the phone.

37
00:01:31,113 --> 00:01:34,518
Hours later, the rhythmic beeping of a heart monitor woke her.

38
00:01:34,518 --> 00:01:35,850
June opened her eyes.

39
00:01:35,850 --> 00:01:41,017
The hospital room was dark, lit only by the streetlights of New York City filtering through the blinds.

40
00:01:41,017 --> 00:01:42,650
Her abdomen felt hollow.

41
00:01:42,650 --> 00:01:46,647
A dull, throbbing pain radiated from her surgical incisions.

42
00:01:46,647 --> 00:01:48,497
The room was completely empty.

43
00:01:48,497 --> 00:01:49,618
There were no flowers.

44
00:01:49,618 --> 00:01:52,574
There was no husband sitting in the chair beside her bed.

45
00:01:52,574 --> 00:01:54,761
A nurse walked in to check her IV drip.

46
00:01:54,761 --> 00:01:56,808
She offered June a look of deep pity.

47
00:01:56,808 --> 00:01:59,289
"Mrs. Compton," the nurse said softly.

48
00:01:59,289 --> 00:02:04,989
"We tried calling the emergency contact number listed in your file several times.A Mr. Compton.

49
00:02:04,989 --> 00:02:06,582
He. he didn't answer. "

50
00:02:06,582 --> 00:02:09,369
June turned her head slowly to look out the window.

51
00:02:09,369 --> 00:02:13,356
The city lights blurred into streaks of gold and silver.She didn't cry.

52
00:02:13,356 --> 00:02:18,102
The tears were gone, replaced by a freezing, solid block of ice in her chest.

53
00:02:18,102 --> 00:02:19,405
She closed her eyes.

54
00:02:19,405 --> 00:02:23,836
The June who loved Cole Compton had died on that operating table.﻿  Chapter 1

55
00:02:23,836 --> 00:02:28,462
On our fifth anniversary, my husband slid a black velvet box across the table.

56
00:02:28,462 --> 00:02:31,408
Inside wasn't a diamond ring, but a fountain pen.

57
00:02:31,408 --> 00:02:34,421
"Sign the separation papers, Aurora," Ethan said.

58
00:02:34,421 --> 00:02:36,167
"Ilene is spiraling again.

59
00:02:36,167 --> 00:02:37,937
She needs to see we are over. "

60
00:02:37,937 --> 00:02:42,557
I was the wife of the Mafia Underboss, yet I was being discarded for the Family Ward.

61
00:02:42,557 --> 00:02:45,473
Before I could answer, Ilene stormed into the restaurant.

62
00:02:45,473 --> 00:02:51,667
She shrieked that I was still wearing his ring and threw a bowl of boiling lobster bisque directly at my chest.

63
00:02:51,667 --> 00:02:55,806
As my skin blistered and peeled, Ethan didn't rush to me.He hugged her.

64
00:02:55,806 --> 00:03:00,005
"It's okay," he soothed the woman who had just assaulted me."I've got you. "

65
00:03:00,005 --> 00:03:01,674
The betrayal didn't stop there.

66
00:03:01,674 --> 00:03:08,061
When Ilene pushed me down the stairs days later, Ethan erased the security footage to protect her from the police.

67
00:03:08,061 --> 00:03:14,085
When I was kidnapped by his enemies, I called his emergency line—the one meant for life-or-death situations.

68
00:03:14,085 --> 00:03:15,409
He declined the call.

69
00:03:15,409 --> 00:03:18,444
He was too busy holding Ilene's hand to save his wife.

70
00:03:18,444 --> 00:03:20,226
That was the moment the chain broke.

71
00:03:20,226 --> 00:03:25,315
As the kidnapper's van sped onto the highway, I didn't wait for a rescue that would never come.

72
00:03:25,315 --> 00:03:27,608
I opened the door and jumped into the dark.

73
00:03:27,608 --> 00:03:30,609
Everyone thought Aurora Bruce died on that pavement.

74
00:03:30,609 --> 00:03:39,477
Two years later, Ethan stood outside a gallery in Paris, looking at the woman he had destroyed, finally realizing he had protected the wrong one.Chapter 1

75
00:03:39,477 --> 00:03:43,358
My husband slid the black velvet box across the crisp white tablecloth.
